    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4edd1ffe2e239a0b3031c020",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "爱丽速子",
      "source_fingerprint": "a7941ccee327c9920214fa57368736bb6e6ffd6ae906a25523b6b8d288d7a3e1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1032/storytimeline_041032001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        29,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/29/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc562804119dd58ee77a4603",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "你真是问了个奇怪的问题呢。\n那种东西，除了『研究的一环』以外还能是什么呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0abbd39f3a9103bd39b992268582cdd9d8d8a9d463edebb46d89d0b2c6515a95",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1032/storytimeline_041032001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        29,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/29/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a602f1151f09dc1447d2731",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "『隐藏着惊人能力的马娘』，连我这个新人训练员\n都听闻过的爱丽速子，现在就站在眼前……",
      "source_fingerprint": "396d2a12b7bdb9eb229c15653cb39632b36f6ff2531d5486995c4f4721d758a6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1032/storytimeline_041032001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e9a9c008b724223aac8cdc8f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（感觉有点瘆人……）",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec0895e5d16ac3f9feba8f4a02dbab962709b4bfe1f4ced7bfc0c29a0da9dd8f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1032/storytimeline_041032001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        30,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/30/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f37d6a40cb5b7918364fbba",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "『研究』――爱丽速子说出这话时，\n眼里闪着诡异的光芒。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f823291b1907e063a80db7da2f8ddda628bc5b6c51e5ee5988bf3c7dd558393d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1032/storytimeline_041032001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        30,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/30/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e73abae2946c6634c6aa6703",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "或许不要跟她扯上关系比较好。\n我这样想着，尝试从椅子上站起来――",
      "source_fingerprint": "07f715dc424ff8fd22d0bc1ca4b3508c9ce95545f4bccb6ad13b66046974418b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1032/storytimeline_041032001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        31,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/31/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d723cecfd5dfbc2b63319ae1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "哎！？动不了！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b8210724e9d585c1b5b115c68a372d4c4441a8cca8065ebc6cd1da2904b6b95",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1032/storytimeline_041032001.json",
