      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "话虽如此，我还是诚心劝你一句，\n至少时刻注意一下自己的状态比较好哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4aae2790fe7ea8d4d9b0d71ed43d8c9d38b37a40270e4cc2edeee600bbeb381c",
